      "interpretation": "For M600, adsorption affinity of PFAAs increased with PFAS alkyl chain length. Across the three resins, affinity followed the order of functional-group hydrophobicity: A111 (dimethylamine) < M600 (dimethylethanolamine) < PSR2Plus (tributylamine), indicating that both strong-base functionality and longer alkyl moieties enhance PFAS sorption.",
